			"offsets": {
				"from": 259400,
				"to": 261360
			},
			"text": " The EEV blog channel, which is the main channel."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:21,820",
				"to": "00:04:25,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 261820,
				"to": 265380
			},
			"text": " EEV blog two, just about to hit 100,000."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:25,440",
				"to": "00:04:26,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 265440,
				"to": 266000
			},
			"text": " But I can't seem to..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:26,000",
				"to": "00:04:26,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 266000,
				"to": 266820
			},
			"text": " I can't seem to damn well do it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:26,860",
				"to": "00:04:30,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 266860,
				"to": 270240
			},
			"text": " It's been sitting on, like, 97,500 for, like, ever."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:31,020",
				"to": "00:04:35,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 271020,
				"to": 275780
			},
			"text": " So subscribe to EEV blog two, where I just put more random stuff and less polished content."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:35,920",
				"to": "00:04:37,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 275920,
				"to": 277760
			},
			"text": " I've also got EEV Academy..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:37,760",
				"to": "00:04:44,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 277760,
				"to": 284460
			},
			"text": " Sorry, EEV Discover as well, where I do, like, you know, interesting site visits or other types of videos."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:44,600",
				"to": "00:04:45,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 284600,
				"to": 285680
			},
			"text": " I've got a..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:45,680",
				"to": "00:04:46,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 285680,
				"to": 286500
			},
			"text": " How did I..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:46,500",
				"to": "00:04:47,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 286500,
				"to": 287500
			},
			"text": " I did some..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:47,500",
				"to": "00:04:51,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 287500,
				"to": 291580
			},
			"text": " My own research on proving that we actually landed on the moon."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:51,860",
				"to": "00:04:53,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 291860,
				"to": 293080
			},
			"text": " So that's a fascinating..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:53,080",
				"to": "00:04:55,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 293080,
				"to": 295100
			},
			"text": " Maybe I'll link that video in if you haven't seen it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:55,120",
				"to": "00:04:55,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 295120,
				"to": 295840
			},
			"text": " It's over on EEV Discovery."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:55,840",
				"to": "00:04:57,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 295840,
				"to": 297680
			},
			"text": " I think it's really quite cool."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:58,060",
				"to": "00:05:02,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 298060,
				"to": 302000
			},
			"text": " So, do you not like these second channels at all?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:02,060",
				"to": "00:05:06,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 302060,
				"to": 306960
			},
			"text": " Do you want me to put absolutely everything, regardless of how crap it is, on the main channel?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:06,960",
				"to": "00:05:08,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 306960,
				"to": 308420
			},
			"text": " Or are you..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:08,420",
				"to": "00:05:09,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 308420,
				"to": 309900
			},
			"text": " Do you only watch the main channel?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:10,000",
				"to": "00:05:11,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 310000,
				"to": 311500
			},
			"text": " You just don't care about anything else?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:12,560",
				"to": "00:05:15,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 312560,
				"to": 315880
			},
			"text": " Are you happy with the current three channels that I've got?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:15,940",
				"to": "00:05:20,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 315940,
				"to": 320060
			},
			"text": " Or would you like a specific channel for tutorials, for example?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:20,160",
				"to": "00:05:25,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 320160,
				"to": 325680
			},
			"text": " Because I've got a lot of tutorial videos out there, and I'm producing more in, sort of, like, a series."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:25,680",
				"to": "00:05:33,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 325680,
				"to": 333120
			},
			"text": " If you haven't noticed, I'm producing, like, starting from basics and getting up and up through, like, almost an entire course type thing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:33,380",
				"to": "00:05:38,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 333380,
				"to": 338160
			},
			"text": " Would you like to see that on a separate EEV Academy channel, for example?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:39,220",
				"to": "00:05:43,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 339220,
				"to": 343520
			},
			"text": " Would you like just an EEV Dumpster channel, where I just do dumpster diving videos?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:43,740",
				"to": "00:05:47,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 343740,
				"to": 347120
			},
			"text": " And, you know, if you only like the dumpster videos, would you like to see?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:47,340",
				"to": "00:05:49,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 347340,
				"to": 349140
			},
			"text": " Or put in something else?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:50,040",
				"to": "00:05:52,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 350040,
				"to": 352760
			},
			"text": " And would you like to see any more categories?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:52,760",
				"to": "00:05:55,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 352760,
				"to": 355520
			},
			"text": " If I don't have enough, would you like me to see..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:55,520",
				"to": "00:05:56,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 355520,
				"to": 356440
			},
			"text": " Any more categories?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:56,620",
				"to": "00:06:01,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 356620,
				"to": 361240
			},
			"text": " And then, yeah, just put your name in the draw if you want to enter the draw."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:01,240",
				"to": "00:06:09,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 361240,
				"to": 369920
			},
			"text": " So, yeah, let's have a look and see what the responses are, because it'll be absolutely fascinating like it was last time."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:10,020",
				"to": "00:06:15,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 370020,
				"to": 375380
			},
			"text": " So, thank you very much in advance for those who link down below to the survey."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:16,060",
				"to": "00:06:21,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 376060,
				"to": 381200
			},
			"text": " And most of the questions, I think there's only one, one of them, two of them that are compulsory."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:21,300",
				"to": "00:06:23,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 381300,
				"to": 383520
			},
			"text": " The rest are optional if you don't want to answer them."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:23,520",
				"to": "00:06:25,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 383520,
				"to": 385360
			},
			"text": " But I really appreciate everyone."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:25,360",
				"to": "00:06:32,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 385360,
				"to": 392100
			},
			"text": " If you're someone entering, you must have, I believe you have, I think you have to have a Google account to do it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:32,120",
				"to": "00:06:32,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 392120,
				"to": 392760
			},
			"text": " I can't remember."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:32,860",
				"to": "00:06:36,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 392860,
				"to": 396740
			},
			"text": " It's using Google Forms, so I'm not entirely sure."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:36,840",
				"to": "00:06:38,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 396840,
				"to": 398200
			},
			"text": " But anyway, there'll be a link down below."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:38,300",
				"to": "00:06:44,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 398300,
				"to": 404800
			},
			"text": " But consider it, everyone's watching this on YouTube anyway, unless you're on my Odyssey channel, which has got more than 60,000 subscribers."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:44,980",
				"to": "00:06:50,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 404980,
				"to": 410400
			},
			"text": " You've probably got a YouTube account anyway, but I'm not sure if you actually need a YouTube account to do it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:50,400",
				"to": "00:06:52,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 410400,
				"to": 412760
			},
			"text": " Anyway, if you do, sorry about that."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:52,820",
				"to": "00:06:55,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 412820,
				"to": 415300
			},
			"text": " It's just a convenient way to do it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:55,360",
				"to": "00:07:02,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 415360,
				"to": 422060
			},
			"text": " So, thanks in advance for the survey and good luck in the contest if you choose to, giveaway, if you choose to enter."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:07:02,360",
				"to": "00:07:02,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 422360,
				"to": 422700
			},
			"text": " Thanks."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:07:03,260",
				"to": "00:07:03,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 423260,
				"to": 423920
			},
			"text": " Catch you next time."
		}
	]
}
